  "description": "Step into a world of timeless authority with Maryam, a premium Old-English typeface designed for high-impact traditionalism. Characterized by its sharp, chiseled edges and a stunning gold-leaf metallic finish, this font captures the essence of medieval heritage and classical prestige. Maryam is an exceptional selection for heraldic logos, certificate designs, luxury spirit labels, and vintage-inspired invitations. This font provides a bold, authoritative voice to any project, blending the grit of history with the polish of modern luxury.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Step into a world of timeless authority with Maryam, a premium Old-English typeface designed for high-impact traditionalism. Characterized by its sharp, chiseled edges and a stunning gold-leaf metallic finish, this font captures the essence of medieval heritage and classical prestige. Maryam is an exceptional selection for heraldic logos, certificate designs, luxury spirit labels, and vintage-inspired invitations. This font provides a bold, authoritative voice to any project, blending the grit of history with the polish of modern luxury.</p>",
